<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! History

The history shelf holds what the house made and how it read itself along the way: the story arcs, record carriers that say where early work landed, verbatim spirit hand-backs, and a pointer to the workshop (in the repository's `scratch/` directory), where every scratch planning record stands word for word. These records inform and never govern; live law rides the api carriers, and live rulings and owed rows ride the road and design memes.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/arcs`>>

