<<~ ahu slot=`#/workshop`>>

!! Workshop

The workshop rests in the repository's `scratch/` directory, outside `bags/` and `wikis/`, so no vessel carries it at boot and no floor snapshot holds it; a wiki may mount it as a shelf when someone wants to read it from inside. Its `index.mem` mirrors `.lares-scratch/` by directory: controller notes, briefs, hand-backs, research waves, resumes, PR bodies, plans and session transcripts, each a verbatim record with its own directory index.

<<~/ahu>>

